'' initialiser, a print item, an expression, an indexed setter, '.P' in a 'with' -- is
'' refused. tiko compiled them: the read gave 0 or garbage and a print item truncated its
'' statement. Setting it, plain or indexed, and reading a property that also has a getter
'' are fine. Lines identical to fbc-modern's errors. See symbols/setteronly.bas.
